{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117603","id":3417475537,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LsonR","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117603","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117603.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117603.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117603","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117603/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117603/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117603/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/055ccf0aea1ab819e8afc28fcfd45d70f4b2ca42","number":117603,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Merge upstream godotengine/master into fork","user":{"login":"HVallad","id":51972693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTcyNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51972693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad","html_url":"https://github.com/HVallad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HVallad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Major Changes Summary\n\nThis is a large merge from the upstream Godot Engine repository containing numerous improvements across the engine. Key highlights include:\n\n## Core & Infrastructure\n- **Decouple and refactor**: Extensive decoupling of core systems (RenderingServer, DisplayServer, etc.) to reduce interdependencies\n- **Include optimization**: Systematic removal of unused includes via clang-tidy integration in CI\n- **Test improvements**: Convert test headers to compilation files for better compile-time organization\n- **Signal ownership**: Move signal ownership from `ClassDB` to `GDType` for better organization\n\n## Rendering & Graphics\n- **HDR output**: Support for HDR output on all platforms including Apple and Linux/Wayland\n- **HarfBuzz update**: Upgrade to 13.1.1 with new raster and vector SVG rendering capabilities\n- **D3D12MA upgrade**: Update to latest D3D12 Memory Allocator\n- **Metal improvements**: Various Metal rendering fixes and optimizations\n- **GLES3 optimizations**: Shader utilities refactoring and include cleanup\n\n## Editor Features\n- **3D editor enhancements**: Vertex snapping, freelook improvements, better orbit controls\n- **Animation editor**: Improvements to BlendSpace editors, animation tree optimization, key visualization\n- **UI/UX improvements**: Better docking system, accessibility enhancements, improved search/filter\n- **Scene painter**: New 2D painting tool for scene editing\n- **GridMap improvements**: Better selection, rotation, collision visualization\n\n## Platform Support\n- **Android**: Haptic feedback, Picture-in-Picture support, improved JNI handling\n- **iOS/visionOS**: UI preference propagation, static library loading fixes\n- **macOS**: ANGLE support in VMs, improved window handling\n- **Linux/Wayland**: HDR support, key mapping improvements, wayland-protocols updates\n- **Web**: Improved SDL joypad support\n\n## Input & Accessibility\n- **Input improvements**: Device IDs for keyboard/mouse events, joypad motion sensors\n- **Accessibility server**: Dedicated accessibility singleton with improved CodeEdit support\n- **Virtual Joystick**: Better styling and configuration options\n\n## Physics & Animation\n- **Jolt Physics**: Update to 5.5.0 with various improvements and fixes\n- **Animation optimization**: Better animation resource/library/mixer/player performance\n- **Tween improvements**: Add `has_tweeners()` method, AwaitTweener support\n\n## GDScript & Scripting\n- **Coroutine fixes**: Proper stack clearing for interrupted coroutines\n- **Performance**: Improved signal emission, better completion for setters/getters\n- **Documentation**: LSP improvements, better error handling\n\n## Build & CI\n- **Python requirement**: Bump to 3.9 minimum\n- **Clang-tidy integration**: Systematic code quality improvements\n- **GitHub Actions**: Enhanced CI with changed-files detection and validation hooks\n\n## Documentation\n- Improved class documentation across audio, physics, rendering, and UI systems\n- Better clarification of feature limitations and platform-specific behaviors\n\nThe merge maintains compatibility while significantly improving code organization, build system, and feature set.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-18T23:38:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T23:39:59Z","closed_at":"2026-03-18T23:39:15Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"35a838929056165bc25c0853c866ee6bc0bc3e6b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HVallad:merge-upstream-2026-03-18","ref":"merge-upstream-2026-03-18","repo":{"id":1094593420,"node_id":"R_kgDOQT4rjA","name":"godot-c-interfaces","full_name":"HVallad/godot-c-interfaces","owner":{"login":"HVallad","id":51972693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTcyNjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51972693?v=4","g